<< /AP << /D 577 0 R /N 578 0 R >> /C [ 0 0 1 ] /CA 0.404999 /Contents (AT ROOT STREET - THE ABSOLUTE SIGNAL GOVERNING WESTWARD MOVEMENTS ON TRACK 1, AT MP 3.7, WILL DISPLAY RULE 9.1.2 \(RESTRICTING\) WHEN THE ROUTE IS LINED FOR MOVEMENT THROUGH THE CROSSOVER, LOCATED AT MP 3.75, AND ONTO EITHER THE NORTH LEG OF THE WYE OR TRACK 6\r\rTHE ABSOLUTE SIGNAL GOVERNING WESTWARD MOVEMENT ON TRACK 2, AT MP 3.7, WILL DISPLAY RULE 9.1.2 \(RESTRICTING\) WHEN THE ROUTE IS LINED FOR MOVEMENT ONTO EITHER THE NORTH LEG OF THE WYE OR TRACK 6\r\rWESTWARD MOVEMENTS ON TRACK 6 MUST MOVE TO WITHIN 100 FEET OF THE ABSOLUTE SIGNAL AT MP 4.1 TO ACTIVATE THE TRACK CIRCUIT AND INDICATE TO THE TERMINAL DISPATCHER THAT THE MOVEMENT IS READY TO PROCEED\r) /CreationDate (D:20050722110037-07'00') /F 156 /M (D:20090809150213-05'00') /NM (5PF2C1wcdZSgo9uOKxKQNB) /Name /Comment /P 13 0 R /Popup 68 0 R /RC (<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:6.0.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2" ><p><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-weight:bold">AT ROOT STREET</span><span style="font-size:10.0pt"> - THE ABSOLUTE SIGNAL GOVERNING WESTWARD MOVEMENTS ON TRACK 1, AT MP 3.7, WILL DISPLAY RULE 9.1.2 \(RESTRICTING\) WHEN THE ROUTE IS LINED FOR MOVEMENT THROUGH THE CROSSOVER, LOCATED AT MP 3.75, AND ONTO EITHER THE NORTH LEG OF THE WYE OR TRACK 6&#13;&#13;THE ABSOLUTE SIGNAL GOVERNING WESTWARD MOVEMENT ON TRACK 2, AT MP 3.7, WILL DISPLAY RULE 9.1.2 \(RESTRICTING\) WHEN THE ROUTE IS LINED FOR MOVEMENT ONTO EITHER THE NORTH LEG OF THE WYE OR TRACK 6&#13;&#13;WESTWARD MOVEMENTS ON TRACK 6 MUST MOVE TO WITHIN 100 FEET OF THE ABSOLUTE SIGNAL AT MP 4.1 TO ACTIVATE THE TRACK CIRCUIT AND INDICATE TO THE TERMINAL DISPATCHER THAT THE MOVEMENT IS READY TO PROCEED&#13;</span></p></body>) /Rect [ 268.184 420.771 288.185 438.772 ] /Rotate 90 /Subj (AT ROOT STREET) /Subtype /Text /T (RID OPS PRO) /Type /Annot >>
