166 0 obj
<< /AP << /D 670 0 R /N 671 0 R >> /BS 672 0 R /C [ 0 0 1 ] /CA 0.404999 /Contents (Effective immediately, the Blue Island tower operator must obtain permission for all movements into track 9 from the CSX "RB" dispatcher \(708 832-2078 or 2074\) prior to movement.  Instructions from the train crew will not be used as authorization for movement into track 9.  After receiving authority from the "RB" dispatcher, you will write the initials of the dispatcher on your train sheet next to the movement record of the train.  You are also to notify the Rock Island road dispatcher that the permission has been received for the movement into track 9.  \r\rIf the CSX "RB" dispatcher calls to verify a westbound movement has cleared track 9, you will give the "OS" time to the CSX dispatcher.  In giving this "OS" you will confirm that the track circuits are clear from track 9 and Robbins.) /F 156 /M (D:20090809131026-05'00') /NM (1905dd2) /Name /Comment /P 20 0 R /Popup 167 0 R /Rect [ 367.286 286.365 387.287 304.366 ] /Rotate 90 /Subj (Bulletin Notice No. 70) /Subtype /Text /T (RID OPS PRO) /Type /Annot >>
endobj
