endobj
170 0 obj
<< /AP << /D 676 0 R /N 677 0 R >> /BS 678 0 R /C [ 0 0 1 ] /CA 0.404999 /Contents (ITEM No. 11 - BLUE ISLAND CONNECTION \(Rock/Electric\)\r\rMetra Electric train #501 carries an average of 40 passengers who connect with the Rock Island District train #411, which departs Blue Island at 5:25 p.m.   Whenever Metra Electric train #501 is running late and there is a question as to whether or not these passengers will make the connection, the Rock Island District dispatcher or Blue Island tower operator will make arrangements to authorize  train #413 or #415 to make an unscheduled stop at Blue Island and pick up the passengers from Metra Electric train #501.\r\rIf it is required to authorize Rock Island train #413 or #415 to stop at Blue Island, the prescribed form will indicate the above information by Blue Island tower operator and also be retained on file.) /F 156 /M (D:20090809130953-05'00') /NM (1905df1) /Name /Comment /P 20 0 R /Popup 171 0 R /Rect [ 134.637 283.527 154.638 301.528 ] /Rotate 90 /Subj (Bulletin Notice No. 155) /Subtype /Text /T (RID OPS PRO) /Type /Annot >>
endobj
