<< /AP << /D 681 0 R /N 682 0 R >> /C [ 0 0 1 ] /CA 0.404999 /Contents (6.32.2 AUTOMATIC WARNING DEVICES\rAT BLUE ISLAND - THE AUTOMATIC WARNING DEVICES AT VERMONT STREET, MP 15.61, AND GROVE STREET, MP 15.7 CAN ALSO BE CONTROLLED MANUALLY BY THE CONTROL OPERATOR AT BLUE ISLAND. CONTROL OPERATOR MUST NOT RAISE GATES WHICH HAVE LOWERED FOR AN APPROACHING TRAIN UNTIL THE TRAIN HAS STOPPED CLEAR OF THE CROSSING\r\r) /CreationDate (D:20050722110702-07'00') /F 156 /M (D:20090809131200-05'00') /NM (b2pBOIxKveXyscGO4b6q7D) /Name /Comment /P 20 0 R /Popup 175 0 R /RC (<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:6.0.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2" ><p><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-weight:bold">6.32.2 AUTOMATIC WARNING DEVICES&#13;</span><span style="font-size:10.0pt">AT BLUE ISLAND - THE AUTOMATIC WARNING DEVICES AT VERMONT STREET, MP 15.61, AND GROVE STREET, MP 15.7 CAN ALSO BE CONTROLLED MANUALLY BY THE CONTROL OPERATOR AT BLUE ISLAND. CONTROL OPERATOR MUST NOT RAISE GATES WHICH HAVE LOWERED FOR AN APPROACHING TRAIN UNTIL THE TRAIN HAS STOPPED CLEAR OF THE CROSSING&#13;&#13;</span></p></body>) /Rect [ 266.128 368.956 286.129 386.956 ] /Rotate 90 /Subj (6.32.2 AUTOMATIC WARNING DEVICES) /Subtype /Text /T (RID OPS PRO) /Type /Annot >>
