<< /AP << /D 874 0 R /N 875 0 R >> /BS 876 0 R /C [ 0 0 1 ] /CA 0.404999 /Contents (CN/IC & BNSF Movements through UD\r\rThe Canadian National/Illinois Central and the Burlington Northern/Santa Fe are both concerned about how trains are routed to the Joliet District through UD interlocking.  In order to eliminate any confusion, the tower operators at UD must contact the CN/IC or BNSF dispatchers before displaying a signal for a train moving through UD to the Joliet District.  Instructions from train crews will not be used as authorization for routing.) /F 156 /M (D:20090809144647-05'00') /NM (1905e21) /Name /Comment /P 30 0 R /Popup 372 0 R /Rect [ 528.677 70.5338 548.678 88.5344 ] /Rotate 90 /Subj (Bulletin Notice No. 70) /Subtype /Text /T (RID OPS PRO) /Type /Annot >>
endobj
