<< /AP << /D 1014 0 R /N 1015 0 R >> /C [ 0 0 1 ] /CA 0.404999 /Contents (6.4.2 MOVEMENTS WITHIN CONTROL POINTS AND INTERLOCKINGS\rAT BLUE ISLAND-WESTWARD PASSENGER TRAINS OR EMPTY EQUIPMENT MOVEMENTS THAT WILL CHANGE DIRECTION AFTER STOPPING AT BLUE ISLAND PASSENGER STATION MAY ACCEPT A PROCEED INDICATION DISPLAYED ON THE EASTWARD ABSOLUTE SIGNAL AT CP VERMONT STREET FOR EASTWARD MOVEMENT AND ARE NOT REQUIRED TO RECEIVE PERMISSION FROM THE CONTROL OPERATOR TO CHANGE DIRECTION\r\rTO ENSURE AUTOMATIC WARNING DEVICES ARE OPERATING FOR THEIR EASTWARD MOVEMENT, WESTWARD PASSENGER TRAINS AND EMPTY EQUIPMENT MOVEMENTS THAT WILL CHANGE DIRECTION WEST OF GROVE STREET MUST RECEIVE PERMISSION FROM THE CONTROL OPERATOR TO CHANGE DIRECTION\r) /CreationDate (D:20050722111135-07'00') /F 156 /M (D:20090809145741-05'00') /NM (DI5TL8pAWO8AZlACno3YTD) /Name /Comment /P 33 0 R /Popup 512 0 R /RC (<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:6.0.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2" ><p><span style="font-size:10.0pt">6.4.2 MOVEMENTS WITHIN CONTROL POINTS AND INTERLOCKINGS&#13;AT BLUE ISLAND-WESTWARD PASSENGER TRAINS OR EMPTY EQUIPMENT MOVEMENTS THAT WILL CHANGE DIRECTION AFTER STOPPING AT BLUE ISLAND PASSENGER STATION MAY ACCEPT A PROCEED INDICATION DISPLAYED ON THE EASTWARD ABSOLUTE SIGNAL AT CP VERMONT STREET FOR EASTWARD MOVEMENT AND ARE NOT REQUIRED TO RECEIVE PERMISSION FROM THE CONTROL OPERATOR TO CHANGE DIRECTION&#13;&#13;TO ENSURE AUTOMATIC WARNING DEVICES ARE OPERATING FOR THEIR EASTWARD MOVEMENT, WESTWARD PASSENGER TRAINS AND EMPTY EQUIPMENT MOVEMENTS THAT WILL CHANGE DIRECTION WEST OF GROVE STREET MUST RECEIVE PERMISSION FROM THE CONTROL OPERATOR TO CHANGE DIRECTION&#13;</span></p></body>) /Rect [ 337.26 294.583 357.261 312.584 ] /Rotate 90 /Subj (Note) /Subtype /Text /T (6.4.2 MOVEMENTS WITHIN CONTROL POINTS AND INTERLOCKINGS) /Type /Annot >>
